      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mentone%2C_Victoria"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Streets such as Cremona, Florence, Venice, Milan and Naples echo the suburb’s Italian resort theme.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mentone%2C_Victoria"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Mentone Beach runs along Beaumaris Bay, featuring a surf lifesaving club, playground and Bay Trail sections.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Mentone,_Victoria"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The area now known as Mentone was part of the Bunurong people’s traditional Kulin territory for tens of thousands of years.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Mentone,_Victoria"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A new train station opened in 2017 on the west side of Southland near Bay Street, replacing the old Balcombe Road stop.",
